# CMS_MAP first

1. Before broad search (`Glob` / wide `Grep` / explore), read root `CMS_MAP.md`.
2. Use symptom→file table; open **1–3 files**, do not scan the repo.
3. Live site content (pages, nav, theme) → MCP `cms_site_map` / digest, not walking `frontend/`.
4. Layer architecture (rare): `ARCHITECTURE.md`.

## Self-update `CMS_MAP.md` in the same change when

- path rename/move; new widget/module/plugin; new frequent symptom→file; MCP tool / deploy path change; mapped path missing on open.

Edit only affected table rows. Navigation only — not bugfix history. Do not wait to be asked.
